{"id":"8325efaf9d443ca2","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct.md","title":"强依赖和","display":"df-strong-dependent-coproduct — 强依赖和","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct","display":"df-strong-dependent-coproduct — 强依赖和","depends_on":["[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]"],"source":"Definition 10.5.2(i), pp. 624–625 (PDF 644–645)","revision_date":"2026-10-19","aliases":["16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-dependent-coproduct — 强依赖和"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f70563c9e9154ec\" href=\"?note=8f70563c9e9154ec\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-quantification\">16-df-comprehension-quantification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.5.2(i), pp. 624–625 (PDF 644–645)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>；固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a> 的同一提升选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak s=(\\Sigma_X,\\Psi_X)_X\">\\(\\mathfrak s=(\\Sigma_X,\\Psi_X)_X\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f70563c9e9154ec\" href=\"?note=8f70563c9e9154ec\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-quantification\">16-df-comprehension-quantification</a> 的候选理解和数据族。仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCoprodData}_{p,\\chi}(\\mathfrak s)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCoprodData}_{p,\\chi}(\\mathfrak s)\\)</span> 成立时使用下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k^{\\mathfrak s},K^{\\mathfrak s}\">\\(k^{\\mathfrak s},K^{\\mathfrak s}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta^{\\Psi_X}\">\\(\\eta^{\\Psi_X}\\)</span> 是该同一伴随的单位，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\">\\(Y\\in\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_1\\)</span> 为理解箭头范畴的定义域函子之箭头分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,K\">\\(k,K\\)</span> 在固定见证时的无上标写法只是下式的缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nk^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\kappa(\\pi_X,\\Sigma_XY)\\circ\\eta^{\\Psi_X}_Y,\\\\\nK^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1\\bigl(\\chi(k^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y})\\bigr),\\\\\n\\pi_{\\Sigma_XY}K^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&amp;=\\pi_X\\pi_Y,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongCompCoprod}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\mathfrak s)\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{CompCoprodData}_{p,\\chi}(\\mathfrak s)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(K^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nk^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\kappa(\\pi_X,\\Sigma_XY)\\circ\\eta^{\\Psi_X}_Y,\\\\\nK^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1\\bigl(\\chi(k^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y})\\bigr),\\\\\n\\pi_{\\Sigma_XY}K^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&amp;=\\pi_X\\pi_Y,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongCompCoprod}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\mathfrak s)\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{CompCoprodData}_{p,\\chi}(\\mathfrak s)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(K^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规范比较由同一单位、提升和理解函子构成。两个左伴随数据之间的规范自然同构把比较箭头相互对应，因此该存在性质不依赖任意的外部选择。它仍表示两次上下文扩张与一次和类型扩张的规范同构。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.5.2(i)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"8f70563c9e9154ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；固定 [[16-df-cleavage]] 的同一提升选择 $\\kappa$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"8f70563c9e9154ec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak s=(\\Sigma_X,\\Psi_X)_X$ 为 [[16-df-comprehension-quantification]] 的候选理解和数据族。仅在 $\\mathrm{CompCoprodData}_{p,\\chi}(\\mathfrak s)$ 成立时使用下面的 $k^{\\mathfrak s},K^{\\mathfrak s}$；$\\eta^{\\Psi_X}$ 是该同一伴随的单位，$X\\in\\mathcal E_I$、$Y\\in\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。$\\operatorname{dom}_1$ 为理解箭头范畴的定义域函子之箭头分量；$k,K$ 在固定见证时的无上标写法只是下式的缩写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak s=(\\Sigma_X,\\Psi_X)_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCoprodData}_{p,\\chi}(\\mathfrak s)","display":false},{"tex":"k^{\\mathfrak s},K^{\\mathfrak s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta^{\\Psi_X}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}_1","display":false},{"tex":"k,K","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nk^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&\\coloneqq\\kappa(\\pi_X,\\Sigma_XY)\\circ\\eta^{\\Psi_X}_Y,\\\\\nK^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1\\bigl(\\chi(k^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y})\\bigr),\\\\\n\\pi_{\\Sigma_XY}K^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y}&=\\pi_X\\pi_Y,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongCompCoprod}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\mathfrak s)\\Bigl[{}&\\mathrm{CompCoprodData}_{p,\\chi}(\\mathfrak s)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(K^{\\mathfrak s}_{X,Y})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2025,"backlinks":[{"id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"满理解、单位、依赖积、强依赖和分别采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]、[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]、[[16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct|df-strong-dependent-coproduct — 强依赖和]]"}],"outgoing":["8f70563c9e9154ec","dacf0503b95c88a9","4ea27d39c2af987b"]}